<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { 
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6; 
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
    }
    
    .container { 
      max-width: 600px; 
      margin: 40px auto; 
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }

    .notice-box {
      background-color: #fff8e1;
      border-left: 4px solid #ffa726;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #636b2f;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      transition: background-color 0.3s;
    }
    
    .cta-button:hover {
      background-color: #4f5625;
    }

    .footer { 
      text-align: center; 
      padding: 20px; 
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      color: #666666; 
      font-size: 12px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5;">

  <div class="container" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
    
    <div class="header" style="background-color: #636b2f; color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800;">FormaChat</h1>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #e8eace;">Service Update</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content" style="padding: 40px 30px;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1a1a1a;">Hello {{firstName}},</p>
      
      <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1a1a1a;">We noticed you recently tried to register with FormaChat but may not have received your verification code due to a temporary service issue.</p>
      
      <div class="notice-box" style="background-color: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #ffa726; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 30px 0;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600;">
          What happened?
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
          Our verification email system experienced a brief interruption. We've resolved the issue and everything is working normally now.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <p style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600;">How to complete your registration:</p>
      
      <ol style="margin: 0 0 20px 20px; padding: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1a1a1a;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Visit the FormaChat login page</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Enter your email address</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">You'll be redirected to the verification page</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Click "Resend Code" to receive a new verification code</li>
      </ol>
      
      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        <a href="https://formachat.com/#/login" class="cta-button" style="background-color: #636b2f; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block;">
          Complete Verification
        </a>
      </div>
      
      <p style="margin: 20px 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
        Your new verification code will arrive within seconds. If you continue to experience issues, please reply to this email.
      </p>
      
      <div style="border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
          We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused.
        </p>
        <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1a1a1a;">Best regards,<br>The FormaChat Team</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer" style="background-color: #f5f5f5; color: #666666; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;">&copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;">If you need assistance, contact us at support@formachat.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>